%% Owner: docs/05-pdf-parsing.md — what happens to one PDF in app/ingest/pdf_parser.py.
flowchart TB
    classDef ingest fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#0b1f4d
    classDef store fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#4b5563,color:#111827
    classDef io fill:#ffffff,stroke:#111827,color:#111827
    classDef legend fill:#fafafa,stroke:#9ca3af,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#374151

    pdf["PDF file"]:::io
    mu["PyMuPDF<br/>get_text dict"]:::ingest
    para["Split into paragraphs<br/>blank line · bold change · ITEM"]:::ingest
    norm["Normalise<br/>NFKC, one space"]:::ingest
    edge["Drop running<br/>headers / footers"]:::ingest
    tab["pdfplumber tables<br/>ruled tables, every page"]:::ingest
    order["Reading order<br/>two-column aware"]:::ingest
    head["Classify headings<br/>PART · ITEM · bold"]:::ingest
    asm["Assemble one text<br/>+ char offsets"]:::ingest
    cache[("data/parsed/KEY.json")]:::store
    legend["Legend<br/>blue = ingestion · grey = storage · white = input"]:::legend

    pdf -->|bytes| mu
    mu -->|blocks, lines, spans, bbox, font| para
    para -->|paragraph blocks| norm
    norm -->|clean text| edge
    edge -->|kept blocks| tab
    tab -->|text blocks + table blocks| order
    order -->|ordered blocks| head
    head -->|blocks + section path| asm
    asm -->|ParsedDocument| cache
